#: 0eadad472aa744b0ba55b32cac381c09
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 25.9 (will need to be adjusted for whichever current sensor is attached)"
msgstr ""

